meta {
  name: Sequence ID Tests
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  # Message Sequence ID Extension Tests
  
  End-to-end tests for the `x-sif-sequenceId` header injection feature.
  
  ## What This Tests
  
  1. Creates a domain/solution/zone infrastructure
  2. Sets up a provider and a consumer with queue + subscription
  3. Emits an event WITHOUT the SEQUENCE_ENABLED tag — verifies NO sequence header
  4. Creates the SEQUENCE_ENABLED entity tag with value "true"
  5. Emits 3 events in serial — verifies the sequence header is present and strictly increasing
  6. Deletes the SEQUENCE_ENABLED entity tag
  7. Emits an event — verifies the sequence header is NO LONGER present
  
  ## Prerequisites
  
  - All services running (gateway, environment-service, events-connector, queue-service, subscription-service)
  - Admin credentials configured in .env
  - The `extensions` module JAR on the events-connector classpath
  - Redis running (used for atomic sequence generation)
  
  ## Run Order
  
  Tests are numbered and must be run in sequence (00–23).
}

